Subset construction (each FA state is the ε-closure of a set of NFA states):
```
       state      a        b
Start  {1}        {2,3,5}  ∅
       {2,3,5}    {5}      {2,3,4,5}
       ∅          ∅        ∅
       {5}        {5}      {5}
Final  {2,3,4,5}  {4,5}    {2,3,4,5}
Final  {4,5}      {4,5}    {5}
```
Merging equivalent states (state minimisation) is also acceptable.
